<title>UK: Aluminium output unchanged in April - IPAI.</title>
<headline>Aluminium output unchanged in April - IPAI.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daily average primary aluminium output in April was unchanged at 52,800 tonnes compared with March and was higher than 50,600 in April 1996, provisional figures from the International Primary Aluminium Institute (IPAI) show.</p>
<p>Total production in April (30 days) was 1.584 million tonnes, compared with 1.636 million in March (31 days) and 1.518 million in April 1996.  </p>
<p>The regional breakdown of primary aluminium production was as follows (in thousands of tonnes) the IPAI said.</p>
<p>			Apr 97   Mar 97    Apr 96</p>
<p>Africa		    91     94	  79</p>
<p>N.America		485    504	 480</p>
<p>S.America		175    180	 174</p>
<p>East/South Asia	156    162	 126</p>
<p>Europe West	    266    274	 261</p>
<p>Europe East/Central  272    279	 264</p>
<p>Ocenaia		  139    143	 134</p>
</text>
